+ When you learn something about a tool that isn't obvious:
+ 1. Add it here immediately
+ 2. Include the gotcha, workaround, and example
+ 3. Reference this file before using tools
+ ## Tool Template
+ ```markdown
+ ### [Tool Name]
+ **What it does:** [Brief description]
+ **Documentation:** [Link]
+ **Documentation:** [Link]
+ **Setup:**
+ - [Step 1]
